{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Kitsune's Paths Tower Defense",
    "steam_appid": 3287330,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287330/extras/f9bb680e951d43c8d9c6d4deb677df7a.avif?t=1744217951\" data-has-big width=800 height=165 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Kitsune\u00b4s Paths:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Kitsune's Paths</strong>, you will step into the role of <strong>Zenko</strong>:<br>A fox guardian of the forests, responsible for protecting the portal that guides benevolent spirits to the next spiritual plane. Use your magical powers, speed, and wits to activate the turrets you'll find along the way, preventing demons from crossing the portals, and gradually becoming the legendary nine-tailed fox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287330/extras/da6257f34193b8e589108bc13560edea.avif?t=1744217951\" data-has-big width=800 height=156 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your strategy:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this Tower Defense, you are the protagonist. Explore the maps, strategically lighting up turrets according to the type of enemy you\u2019re facing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287330/extras/ee93b6a00cbd3383094772911e6388cf.avif?t=1744217951\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cast new spells:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new skills and level up your character. The full game will include a skill tree to upgrade the spells of your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287330/extras/c0871d7a8e3ad2adce5de4a403d47e45.avif?t=1744217951\" data-has-big width=800 height=203 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Protect the worlds:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenging levels to discover new worlds and help more benevolent spirits cross through the toriis. For each world protected, you will be granted a new tail, until you become the mythical nine-tailed fox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may be interested in:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full game will feature 24 levels (with the possibility of adding some extras).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 types of turrets, upgradable to level 3, with 5 elemental options to customize each one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New powers and abilities for Zenko.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 different worlds, with fully hand-painted backgrounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 unique enemies, all Yokai demons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable benevolent spirits to help along the way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287330/extras/b188898b83c1de60c4cc8c147ed7e44b.avif?t=1744217951\" data-has-big width=800 height=524 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287330/extras/f9bb680e951d43c8d9c6d4deb677df7a.avif?t=1744217951\" data-has-big width=800 height=165 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Kitsune\u00b4s Paths:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Kitsune's Paths</strong>, you will step into the role of <strong>Zenko</strong>:<br>A fox guardian of the forests, responsible for protecting the portal that guides benevolent spirits to the next spiritual plane. Use your magical powers, speed, and wits to activate the turrets you'll find along the way, preventing demons from crossing the portals, and gradually becoming the legendary nine-tailed fox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287330/extras/da6257f34193b8e589108bc13560edea.avif?t=1744217951\" data-has-big width=800 height=156 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your strategy:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this Tower Defense, you are the protagonist. Explore the maps, strategically lighting up turrets according to the type of enemy you\u2019re facing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287330/extras/ee93b6a00cbd3383094772911e6388cf.avif?t=1744217951\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cast new spells:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new skills and level up your character. The full game will include a skill tree to upgrade the spells of your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287330/extras/c0871d7a8e3ad2adce5de4a403d47e45.avif?t=1744217951\" data-has-big width=800 height=203 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Protect the worlds:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenging levels to discover new worlds and help more benevolent spirits cross through the toriis. For each world protected, you will be granted a new tail, until you become the mythical nine-tailed fox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may be interested in:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full game will feature 24 levels (with the possibility of adding some extras).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 types of turrets, upgradable to level 3, with 5 elemental options to customize each one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New powers and abilities for Zenko.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 different worlds, with fully hand-painted backgrounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 unique enemies, all Yokai demons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable benevolent spirits to help along the way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287330/extras/b188898b83c1de60c4cc8c147ed7e44b.avif?t=1744217951\" data-has-big width=800 height=524 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Protect the portals and aid the good spirits in this 2D tower defense game. Stop demons from invading by activating turrets along the paths. As the forest protector, use your speed and strategy to keep peace across the realms, transforming into the legendary nine-tailed fox to fulfill your destiny.",
